"clear:both\">\r\n<font face=\"courier new, monospace\">model {</font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    x  ~ normal(m, s);  // fit</font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">} </font></p>\r\n<p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">generated quantities { </font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    real lp;</font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br>\r\n</font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    lp &lt;- normal_log(x,m,s);</font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">}</font></p><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">\r\ncode and documentation is attached.</p><div>Best regards,</div><div><br></div><div>Christian</div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
